  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting freedom of expression and online platforms governance in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative seeks to contribute to the protection of fundamental rights, namely freedom of expression, through awareness raising on (1) international standards on freedom of expression; (2) the importance to guarantee the safety of journalists, including women journalists, and (3) the principles for digital platform governance towards the realization of sustainable development goals (SDG 16) in West Africa.</narrative>
